    "automation": {
      "status": "full",
      "notes": "<p>Use button (Free action): a Toughness and Evasion bonus by level until the start of your next turn (out of combat, until you switch it off), also given to allies within 5 ft from 5th level. From 13th level you pick a damage type you resist while it lasts; from 18th, a damage type you are immune to, with Resistance to every other. Automatic: the permanent bonus from 7th level, which doesn't add to the temporary one.</p>"
